Attribution and independence
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Oracle is an independent implementation of the multi-agent research workflow described
in "Towards an AI co-scientist" (Gottweis et al., Google, 2025; arXiv:2502.18864) —
the generation / reflection / proximity / ranking / evolution / meta-review loop with an
Elo tournament — extended with novelty injection, a deterministic adaptive scheduler,
evidence verification, synthesis and adversarial challenge.

No code from that work is included here. This project is NOT affiliated with, sponsored
by, or endorsed by Google LLC, Anthropic PBC, or OpenAI.

Oracle invokes third-party command-line tools that it does not distribute:

  * Claude Code CLI (@anthropic-ai/claude-code) — Anthropic PBC
  * Codex CLI (@openai/codex) — OpenAI

